---
---
<section id="accueil" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/images/hero-bg.png');"></div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <div class="hero-text animate-fade-in">
      <span class="subtitle">Bienvenue dans mon univers</span>
      <h1>Les Pensées de <span class="text-gradient">Mina</span></h1>
      <p class="poem">
        "Ici, les mots dansent entre ombre et lumière,<br/>
        Des éclats de joie aux larmes de poussière.<br/>
        Entre tes mains, mon cœur se décline,<br/>
        Dans chaque vers, une émotion se dessine."
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#pensees" class="btn btn-primary">Explorer mes pensées</a>
        <a href="#pensees" class="btn btn-outline">Lire un poème</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-top: 80px; /* Espace pour le header */
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    z-index: -2;
    transform: scale(1.1);
    animation: zoomOut 20s infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes zoomOut {
    from { transform: scale(1.1); }
    to { transform: scale(1); }
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(240, 247, 255, 0.9), rgba(240, 247, 255, 0.3));
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .poem {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-light);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 200px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(126, 182, 226, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #6a9fd1;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    border: 2px solid var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-top: 100px;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .hero-overlay {
      background: rgba(240, 247, 255, 0.85);
    }

    .hero-text {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .poem {
      border-left: none;
      padding-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--primary-light);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary-light);
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    
    .btn {
      flex: none;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 300px;
    }
  }
</style>
